Dear Ethan Womack,

Thank you for your patience as I conducted an investigation into concerns t=
hat were raised regarding your alleged actions. Amazon takes concerns of th=
is nature seriously and has a process in place to investigate. My role in t=
his process was to be a fair and objective fact finder and to conduct a com=
plete and thorough investigation. As part of this process, I spoke with rel=
evant parties and reviewed relevant documentation.


The investigation is now complete. Based on the facts gathered, the investi=
gation found your conduct resulted in one or more violations of Amazon poli=
cy.  Your manager and/or HR representative have attempted to follow up with=
 you on November 25, 2025 to discuss findings and any follow-up actions but=
 we were not able to connect with you. Amazon is committed to providing a s=
afe working environment for all associates, and it is every associate=92s r=
esponsibility to work in a safe, responsible manner identifying unsafe situ=
ations to management immediately. Due to failure to comply with these expec=
tations, separation of employment will be effective immediately. If you hav=
e any questions or concerns specific to the investigation, please let me kn=
ow.


Amazon now considers this investigation to be closed. If you believe there =
was any information or documentation that was not considered as part of thi=
s investigation, please send it to me for immediate review.


As a reminder, Amazon has a policy prohibiting retaliation against anyone w=
ho has raised a complaint or who has participated in an investigation. Amaz=
on expects that anyone who participates in an investigation will not engage=
 in any retaliatory behavior =96 this applies to and has been discussed wit=
h all the parties in the investigation. In addition, Amazon will only discu=
ss this investigation with those individuals who have a legitimate business=
 need to know.


Thank you again for your cooperation,

TPA4 PXT
